WEBVTT

00:00:00.067 --> 00:00:03.600
Admins open the faction editor with /viscript_team faction

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:11.333
The ID is fixed after creation; the display name can be changed

00:00:11.333 --> 00:00:17.000
Faction color is a representative color; name tags still use attitude colors

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:20.633
Click Save after editing; entity membership and reputation use separate commands
